  "description": {
    "text": "The 2009 spring Collector's Tins, released on 2 March 2009, each held two Platinum booster packs, one Stormfront and one Secret Wonders pack, and a holofoil LV.X: Dialga LV.X DP37, Giratina LV.X DP38 or Shaymin LV.X DP39, the three stars of the film Giratina and the Sky Warrior, each an earlier LV.X with a new drawing. Ads promised a Pokémon Trading Figure Game figure in each tin, but delays kept the figures out.",
